# DSYM - Convert a linker report to DASM symbols

```text
B0:DSYM [DU:]base.LOG [destination-DU:]
```

## Make symbols

```text
B0:DLINK PROGRAM
B0:DSYM PROGRAM.LOG
```

DSYM uses the completed checked report from [DLINK](DLINK.HLP) to
produce PROGRAM.DSY. A bare .SYM file lacks the link completion
information DSYM needs.

## Load the symbols

```text
B0:DASM
RPROGRAM.COM
RPROGRAM.DSY
```

The last two lines are [DASM](DASM.HLP) commands. Use the binary from
the same link so the addresses match the program you are inspecting.
